arch currently matches against raw property paths, which may include URI encoding or dot-suffixed internal tags. This PR introduces a small normalization step when filtering properties in the Sectioned Inspector so that search queries operate on user-visible names instead.\r\n\r\nThe normalization:\r\n\r\n- decodes URI-encoded leaf names,\r\n- removes dot-suffixes from property names,\r\n- keeps section paths unchanged.\r\n\r\n\r\nWithout this fix you are able to search certain terms (like \"uuid\") and able to see categories that have all entries filtered\r\n\r\n4.5:\r\n<img width=\"1202\" height=\"732\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c2b3a71-ff9c-4ccc-8fcf-4ec3c8de8b7f\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"725\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a011028-f217-44f8-bcfa-a9f10a7cdc2b\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAll this is accomplished using a new helper function in editor_sectioned_inspector.cpp\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gra